  "title": "Garlic Baked Ham",
  "description": "In this garlic baked ham seven-ingredient recipe, a whole ham is infused with 20 cloves of garlic and basted with a pineapple and brown sugar-glaze.",
  "authors": [
    "Allison Fletcher Acosta"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:08:44-05:00",
